      'If your domain is not directly cited inside the generative synthesis box, your click-through rates on traditional organic positions are falling off a digital cliff. Fortunately, Google\'s generative engine does not extract information by magic. It relies on structured retrieval pipelines, semantic entity vectorization, and deterministic citation scoring.',
      'In this exhaustive guide, we break down our proprietary agency blueprint for **how to optimize for Google AI Overviews in 2026**, covering verified data, information architecture frameworks, schema graphs, and practical execution checklists that secure premier citations.',
      
